  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 23",
  "verseCount": 56,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yaleerwa imbeli waPilato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omukhung'aano kwabo kwosi nikurula, nibamuyila imbeli waPilam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibachaaka okhumwinjilila, bari Khwanyoolile omundu uno nakosinjia lihanga lieefwe, nabakaaninjia oburamurunjila Kaisari obushuru ta, nasunganga shinga omwene olwa ali Kristo, omuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Pilato namureeba mbu Niwe Omuruchi wabaYahudi? Naye nakalusia namusunjila mbu Nolwa oboola iwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Pilato nasunjila abakuhani abakhulundu nende abemikanda ari Shinduutsi eshikha shiosi mumundu uno ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo nibameeta okhumuluunyia, bari Ayakulanga abandu, niyeechesia mubuYahudi mwosi, okhurula eGalilaya kata okhuula hano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yaleerwa imbeli waHerode",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Pilato yahulila ario, yareeba akomundu oyo, mbu yakhaba omuGalilaya noho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa yahulila mbu nowomuburuchi bwaHerode, yamuruma ewaHerode, shichila ye yesi yali nali eYerusalemu mundaalo tsienetsio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho olwa Herode yalola Yesu, yatsatsahala muno; okhuba neshise eshirambi eshia yali niyeekombanga okhumulola, shichila yali niyahulila amakhuwa khuye; khandi yasuubila mbu yakhalola eshilolelo shiamakana nishikholwa ninaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nachaaka okhumureebelesia amakhuwa amanji; nayenalamukalusialikhuwata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abakuhani abakhulundu nabahandiichi nibasinjilaho nibamwimaalila butinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Herode halala nende abasikaribe nibamulechela elala, nibamunyokhoosia, nibamufwala ebiifwalo ebing'inang'inu; namukalusia ewaPilato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Herode nende Pilato nibahambana obwitsa inyanga yeneyo; okhuba balinji nibahambana obusuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yakhalachilwa eshiina shiokhufwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Pilato nakhung'aasia halala abakuhani abakhulundu nende abaami nende abandu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nabasunjila ari Mumwinjiliile omundu uno ewanje, mbu noukosinjia abandu; nasi, lole, enoonelesiye akeke imbeli weenywe, nindanyoola eshikha shiosi mumundu uno khumakhuwa ako aka mumwinjiliile ninako ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kata Herode yesi ta; shichila ye amukalusiye eweefwe; ne lole, libulaho likhuwa liosi elia yakholile elichila nakwanile okhwirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako nemunyweshe, nimulekhuula. [",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yalinji nakhoyile okhubalekhuulila omubohe mulala mwisabo elo.] ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa bosi halala nibayiiba, bari Rusia omundu oyo; okhulekhuulile Baraba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye nomundu owabohwa mumbohe khulwa induli eyeekhola mwitookho halala nende obwiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Pilato nasungana ninabo khandi, niyeenys okhulekhuula Yesu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nabo nibayochela, bari Omubambe, omubambe khumusalaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabasunjila olwakhataru, ari Ne nibii shiina elia omundu uno akholile? Shinyoolile likhuwa muye elichila yeerwe ta; ndalamunywekha, nimulekhuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bachinga olukhu, nibamuluunyia, nibasaba mbu abambwe khumusalaba. Okhuyochela khwabwe nikhuhula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Pilato nakhalaka eshiina, mbu bakholelwe aka basabile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalekhuula omwenoyo owali naboyilwe mumbohe khulwa induli nende obwiri, omwenoyo owa basaba; ne yamuhaana Yesu mbu bamukholele aka beenya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yabambwa khumusalaba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa bali nibashimurusia batiila omundu mbu Simoni, omuKirene, owali narulanga mumikunda, nibamutuukha omusalaba, akuchinje namulondakhwo Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukanda omukhongo kwabandu nikumulondakhwo, nende okwabakhasi abamulilila nibakhupa tsimbungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Yesu nabashiukhanila, nasunga mbu Inywe abakhasi beYerusalemu, murandilila isie ta, ne mwililile abeene, nende abaana beenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba lole, tsindaalo tsili okhwitsa, olwa baliboola mbu Nabeikhabi abakumba, nende tsinda etsirayeebulakhwo, nende tsimbeele etsiranuunia tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana balichaaka okhusunjila tsingulu bari Khukwile; nende ebikulu, bari Khufwimbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba nibaba nibakholela bario omusaala omubisi, ne balakukholela barie okuli omuumu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi bali nibaliho abandi babili, abakhayi bamalako, abarusibwa ninaye halala khukhwirwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa boola ahalangwa mbu Eshihanganga, niho aha bamubambila khumusalaba, nende abakhayi bamalako abo, mulala khumukhono musaatsa, noundi khumukhono mukhasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu naboola mbu Papa, obaleshele; shichila shibamanya eshia bakhola shinga olwa shili ta. Nibakabana ebiifwalobie, nibabiupila ikha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu nabo nibasinjilaho nibahenga. Abakhulundu nabo nibamuchaya, nibasunga bari Yahonia abandi; yeehonie omwene, uno naba naliye Kristo waNyasaye, omulobolewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasikari nabo nibamunyokhoosia, nibamutsiila, nibamuheelesia idivai eyiraanyile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibasunga bari Noba noli iwe Omuruchi wabaYahudi, wihonie omwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi lihandiiko lialiho hekuluwe, mbu UNO NIYE OMURUCHI WABAYAHUDI.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mulala khubakhayi abafungwahol namumyeka, ari Shioli iwe Kristo watsana? Wihonie omwene nende ifwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne oundi naye nakalusia namuhalabila, nasunga ari Kata shioria Nyasaye ta, olwa oli mushiina shilala shieneshio? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neefu, eshiina shikhufwiliile habwene; okhuba khunyoola omurungo okuhela ebikhole bieefwe; ne omundu uno shiyakholile likhuwa liosi elirakhoyeele ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasunga mbu Yesu, unzitsulile olwa oleetsa mubwamibwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye namukalusia mbu Ekhuboolela toto mbu leelo khulaba ninawe muParadiso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhufwa khwaYesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yali niyulile khusaa yakhasasaba, eshialo shiosi nishiikhola eshiilima okhuula khusaa yashienda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omubasu nikuhweelela obulafu bwakwo; ingubo ishinga eyomuhekalu niyirandushila hakari wayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Yesu yali nayiibile nomwoyo omukhongo, yaboola ari Papa, ehaana omwoyo kwanje mumakhonoko; ne olwa yali niyakhaboola ario, yakhalikha omwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omuseesia olwa yalola akakholekha, yaheelesia Nyasaye oluyali, naboola mbu Nitoto, uno abeele omundu omulunjishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abemikanda chiosi echiali nichikhung'aanile okhulola amakhuwa ako, olwa balola akeekholekha, bakalukha nibeekhong'onda butswa khubilifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abamanyana ninaye, halala nende abakhasi balia abali nibalondaanenje ninaye okhurula eGalilaya, nibasinjila ehalekhwo nibahenga amakhuwa ako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yaalisibwa mung'ani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lola, yaliho omundu oweliiralie mbu Yusufu, owali omukofu owomushiina, omundu omulayi khandi omulunjishi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shiyali nafuchiiliile eshiina eshia bakhalaka, kata eshikhole shiabwe ta; nomundu weArimatsaya, litookho lindi liabaYahudi, owali nalindiililanga obwami bwaNyasaye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omundu uno natsia ewaPilato, namusaba omulambo kwaYesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nakwakula, nakufwimba mungubo yeikitani, namwalisia mung'ani eyayabwa mulwanda, eya omundu arashiaalisibwamwo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yali inyanga eyokhwikhwanilia, khandi Sabato yali niyili ahambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abakhasi abali nibarulile ninaye eGalilaya nibalondakhwo inyuma, nibalola ing'ani, nende omulambokwe shinga olwa kwaalisibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibakalukha, nibakasia emisaala chieshing'aari nende amafura. Ne khuSabato nibahuluukha, lilako shinga olwa liali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
